  please cite the Zenodo preprint below.  When the journal version
  appears, the ``preferred-citation`` block will be updated with the
  published reference; the Zenodo DOI will remain valid as the
  archived preprint.
title: >
  Lyceum: a fully-local multimodal system for narrated visualisation
  of mathematical textbooks
